{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293070","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1029307001:0":{"text":"梅拉奶奶泡的茶也太好喝了吧！连我这种不喜欢茶的人都觉得好美味！","source_cn":"梅拉奶奶泡的茶也太好喝了吧！连我这种不喜欢茶的人都觉得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9ABBADA78D3A7341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029307002:0":{"text":"啊不对，梅拉奶奶，其实我们是有正事想要找你的！你知道之前圣石失窃的事件嘛？","source_cn":"啊不对，梅拉奶奶，其实我们是有正事想要找你的！你知道之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93387236C3822088","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029307003:0":{"text":"啊？你说什么“生食”？你要吃这些用来泡茶的叶片吗，那可不行啊，这么吃对身体不好……","source_cn":"啊？你说什么“生食”？你要吃这些用来泡茶的叶片吗，那可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554410B65A951AC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029307004:0":{"text":"不不不不是，我是说圣石啦，圣——石——！","source_cn":"不不不不是，我是说圣石啦，圣——石——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x632F0AA7D6EF7019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029307005:1":{"text":"呜哇，菲突然用了好大的音量，耳朵都有点不舒服了！","source_cn":"呜哇，菲突然用了好大的音量，耳朵都有点不舒服了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EEBD73CC6C71903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","do